  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Use the exact product names and matching image URLs from image_urls.shopee_products in the catalog view.",
    "Ensure all product cards feature square (1:1) aspect ratio product image containers with smooth hover zoom effects.",
    "Add prominent discount percentage badges (e.g., '-35% OFF') and price tags in amber/orange.",
    "Add 'Ver na Shopee' affiliate action buttons on each product card leading to affiliate destination or modal.",
    "Add data-testid to all interactive buttons, search inputs, filter tabs, and product cards.",
    "Maintain high visual contrast (WCAG AA compliant) with dark background (#0A0A0C) and dark studio product imagery."
